extends ../../_layout.pug

block vars
  - var root = "../../"
  - var title = "Scoring for Das Apartment, season two – Leo Auri"

block content
  article
    header
      h1
        a(href='index.html') Scoring for Das Apartment, season two
      time(pubdate) October 3, 2018
    p
      | I worked on original music for the second season of 
      a(href='https://www.facebook.com/webisodeberlin/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Das Apartment
      | :
    .embed-container
      iframe(src='https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/vTXzRwHVGaw?rel=0' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen).


    p
      | It’s a “Comedy-Webisode” created by 
      a(href='http://grainofsalt.eu/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Reinaldo Almeida
      |  and a lot friends from the 
      a(href='https://www.comedycafeberlin.com/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Berlin-expat Comedy Scene
      | . Also my brother 
      a(href='http://jolyon-auri.tumblr.com/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Jolyon Auri
      |  worked on props, designed the sets, and created a bunch of artworks that appear throughout!
    p
      | The season was released on 3/10/2018 and is currently available via 
      a(href='https://vimeo.com/ondemand/dasapartment' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Vimeo On Demand
      |  and 
      a(href='https://www.pantaflix.com/en/s/759365/2' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Pantaflix
      | .
  nav.
